  <name>ScopeExclusions</name>
  <type>clidocumentation:ScopeExclusions</type>
  <baseType>core:Documentation</baseType>
  <is>Explicitly out of V1 CLI library scope</is>

  <documentation>Not V1 in this package (may exist in MD vision only):
    • init, new block, inspect, watch, activate-config commands
    • bom-cli.config.json command renaming
    • Incremental build cache .bom-cache/ (C5)
    • Thumbnail generation OpenSCAD+Sharp (C6)
    • resolveOpenScad.ts, resolveMbLib.ts
    • --force flag
    • machineblocks-v3-scad target registration
    • Config profiles (activeConfig)
    • Codegen from BML to TypeScript (structural SSOT only in V1)</documentation>

</block>
